<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <title>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Select delivery parameters</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>انتخاب پارامترهای تحویل</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Выбор параметров доставки</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Teslimat parametrelerinin seçimi</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Select delivery parameters</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Select delivery parameters</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Select delivery parameters</value>
  </title>
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>CaptionCaption</name>
    <id>5</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Data for the current row with changed delivery parameters is already added to the trip. Select the parameters under which new data will be transferred to the document: you can choose delivery parameters from the trip or keep them according to the planned ones (by default, the row with planned parameters is highlighted).</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>داده‌های سطر جاری با پارامترهای تحویل تغییریافته قبلاً به سفر افزوده شده است. پارامترهایی را که داده‌های جدید بر اساس آن‌ها به سند منتقل می‌شوند انتخاب کنید: می‌توانید پارامترهای تحویل را از سفر انتخاب کنید یا آن‌ها را طبق موارد برنامه‌ریزی‌شده نگه دارید (به‌طور پیش‌فرض، سطر دارای پارامترهای برنامه‌ریزی‌شده برجسته است).</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>В рейс уже добавлены данные по текущей строке с измененными параметрами доставки. Необходимо выбрать параметры, с которыми новые данные будут перенесены в документ: можно выбрать параметры доставки из рейса или оставить согласно плановым (по умолчанию выделена строка с плановыми параметрами)</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Mevcut satıra göre değiştirilmiş teslimat parametreleriyle sefere zaten veri eklenmiş. Yeni verilerin belgeye hangi parametrelerle aktarılacağı seçilmelidir: Seferdeki teslimat parametreleri seçilebilir veya planlananlara göre bırakılabilir (varsayılan olarak planlanan parametrelerin olduğu satır seçilidir)</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Data for the current row with changed delivery parameters is already added to the trip. Select the parameters under which new data will be transferred to the document: you can choose delivery parameters from the trip or keep them according to the planned ones (by default, the row with planned parameters is highlighted).</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Data for the current row with changed delivery parameters is already added to the trip. Select the parameters under which new data will be transferred to the document: you can choose delivery parameters from the trip or keep them according to the planned ones (by default, the row with planned parameters is highlighted).</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Data for the current row with changed delivery parameters is already added to the trip. Select the parameters under which new data will be transferred to the document: you can choose delivery parameters from the trip or keep them according to the planned ones (by default, the row with planned parameters is highlighted).</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>CaptionCaptionExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>7</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
